<title>USA: Omaha cattle $1.00-2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $1.00-2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter Steers and heifers slow, $1.00-2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Mixed Select and Choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 63.50-64.50. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select and Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 63.00-63.50, load mostly Choice 1111 lbs 65.00. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
